# _CoqProject for the ponoma risk-gate proofs (the formal twin of paper::risk_check).
#
# Standalone check:   coqc RiskGate.v        (or: rocq compile RiskGate.v)
# Via coq_makefile:   rocq makefile -f _CoqProject -o CoqMakefile && make -f CoqMakefile
# Or from the crate:  make -C .. verify
#
# RiskGate.v only depends on the Rocq/Coq standard library (Stdlib.QArith), so no external
# libraries are required. The logical mapping below keeps IDE/dune tooling happy.

-Q . RiskGate

RiskGate.v
